ship = KSS Demo Model 3
version = 1.12.2
description = This variant is more accurate to the current status of the ISS. Truss segments are still collapsed into fewer sections, some parts only are to connect via claws, so they are bolted near their intended positions with disposable decouplers. Missing: Dextre, the MBS (Canadarm2 can move anywhere anyhow), & the European robotic arm.¨¨Accurate to July 26th, 2021. Missing a Dragon capsule.
